    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2018_0503","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Saoirse Gómez talks about the installation that was mistaken for scaffolding. There is a long passage about a single brush, which the artist calls "the elder".</Description>
